  isRight: 00010001000101000001
  dialogues:
  - Quick ! Walk through that door before more of them come !
  - But what will you do ?
  - "I don\u2019t know but i will make it out alive, i promise, please just leave."
  - "I really don\u2019t understand why you helped me\u2026"
  - "Oh\u2026 I supposed nobody ever helped you and I couldn't stand the angels anymore
    anyways. This was on my mind for years and when I saw you, I knew what I needed
    to do."
  - ...
  - Thank you.
  - You need to survive. Remember your promise.
  - Goodbye, Lucy.
  - Goodbye, Grim Reaper.
